{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "42069f3f-aa25-8f3a-ad88-8b621dfb97d0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T14:43:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um. This is Paula Moniz. [pause] I'm calling about a drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Paula. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate. At the curb. [pause] It's sunk down. Maybe three inches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunk down below the pavement, so it's like a dip around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Exactly. [pause] And the water goes everywhere. Except down it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. And where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighteen Van Zandt Avenue. [pause] In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighteen Van Zandt, got it. Is this since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The one Friday into Saturday. [pause] Two days ago. But it's been like this. Since before. Every time it rains it's the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's a repeat thing. Is the water standing there now, or has it drained off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some is still there. [pause] And it runs. Toward my neighbor's garage. [pause] Sideways. Down the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it getting into the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. [pause] It's close. Right up to the door. [pause] I'm worried it'll go in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll make sure that's noted so the crew knows there's a property at risk. Anything else you can tell me about the grate? Is it cracked, or is it just the ground that's settled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ground. I think. [pause] The grate looks okay. It's just low. [pause] No, wait. High. The road is higher. Around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so the pavement's built up around it and the grate's sitting in a low spot, but the water's still bypassing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It goes around. [pause] Like it doesn't want to go in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Let me get this entered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask something? [pause] Is that a city drain? Or a state one? [pause] Somebody told me it might be the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. A lot of the streets are city, but some main roads belong to the state. Van Zandt is a city street as far as I know, so I'd treat it as ours. If it turns out to be the state's, we pass it along to them ourselves. You wouldn't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. [pause] Because I called once. Before. Somebody said it wasn't theirs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. I don't see how that went, but I'll put this in fresh with today's date and the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] It's just. It keeps happening. [pause] Nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Crews are stretched after a storm like that, but a sunken grate with water heading for a garage is something I'll flag. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] The cars drive through it. The puddle. [pause] There's a hole too, I think. Under the water. I can't see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. Hidden pothole under standing water, I'll add that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My tires. [pause] I'm budgeting. For a new set. [pause] Already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, I'm sorry. If you do get damage, you can ask about filing a claim, but let's try to get the drain fixed first. Is this number, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-six, the best one for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. [pause] It's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. If the crew has questions, they'll call you. Anything else, Paula?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] Just. Please. Send somebody. [pause] Before the next one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do my best to get it moving. Take care, and stay out of that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T14:43:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
